      "writtenOn": "2024-01-24T04:13:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are 8 announcements: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Connectivity/service-t/src/com/android/server/connectivity/mdns/MdnsAnnouncer.java;drc\u003d1a1beee654a8ad06cc65be0e0f420249071236e5;l\u003d40\n\nThey just become very infrequent after a few seconds. I don\u0027t think you should wait for 3 (it just makes the test slow and there\u0027s no reason to do that exact number), you can just wait for 1: when the first announcement is received, that means probing has completed.",
